{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"less","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Less","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Less (.less).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"less","name":"Less","extensions":[".less"],"grammar":"grammars/less.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Less","path":"snippets/less.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/less.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"property\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"#[0-9a-fA-F]{3,8}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[A-Za-z-]+(?=\\\\s*:(?!:))\",\n      \"token\": \"attribute\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"[.#&][A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_-]*\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b\\\\d+(?:\\\\.\\\\d+)?(?:px|em|rem|%|vh|vw|s|ms)?\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:@font-face|@keyframes|@import|@plugin|@media)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/less.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Variable\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"var\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@${1:name}: ${2:value};\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A variable\"\n  },\n  \"Mixin\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mixin\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \".${1:name}(@${2:arg}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A mixin\"\n  },\n  \"Media query\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"mq\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"@media (min-width: ${1:768px}) {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A media query\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Less\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Less.\n\n## Files\n\n`.less`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 3 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `var` | A variable |\n| `mixin` | A mixin |\n| `mq` | A media query |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}